(1828887, 251468, 39429, '<td valign="top">Hurling as a topic is not the most appealing to me unless it makes me laugh.  This pumpkin didn''t.  You''ve got a wonderful glow, but lost detail and sharpness.  The effect was not enough to make it work for me.  4</td>', 'Hurling as a topic is not the most appealing to me unless it makes me laugh.  This pumpkin didn''t.  You''ve got a wonderful glow, but lost detail and sharpness.  The effect was not enough to make it work for me.  4', '2005-11-01 00:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828891, 251031, 28882, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time with this one...</td>', 'I''m having a hard time with this one...', '2005-11-01 00:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828892, 251582, 34659, '<td valign="top">Eewww...  LOL  Nice detail in B/W and good use of the pumpkin''s natural shape for your carving choice.</td>', 'Eewww...  LOL  Nice detail in B/W and good use of the pumpkin''s natural shape for your carving choice.', '2005-11-01 00:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828893, 251594, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute...</td>', 'Cute...', '2005-11-01 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828894, 251823, 28882, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful..</td>', 'this is beautiful..', '2005-11-01 00:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828895, 251614, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool gang!  I like the light burst.</td>', 'Cool gang!  I like the light burst.', '2005-11-01 00:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828896, 251940, 28882, '<td valign="top">that''s hot!!!</td>', 'that''s hot!!!', '2005-11-01 00:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828897, 251936, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some expressive faces here.  However, they are not interesting enough to me to stand alone without some other detail to pull me in.  You have been able to keep the carvings sharp. 4</td>', 'You''ve got some expressive faces here.  However, they are not interesting enough to me to stand alone without some other detail to pull me in.  You have been able to keep the carvings sharp. 4', '2005-11-01 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828899, 251598, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this processing...  I like the expression.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this processing...  I like the expression.', '2005-11-01 00:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828900, 251808, 28882, '<td valign="top">disco jack!</td>', 'disco jack!', '2005-11-01 00:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828901, 251724, 28882, '<td valign="top">nothing happened</td>', 'nothing happened', '2005-11-01 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828902, 251909, 34659, '<td valign="top">That took some patience!  LOL  Nice job!</td>', 'That took some patience!  LOL  Nice job!', '2005-11-01 00:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828903, 251927, 39429, '<td valign="top">This grouping works together with a common style of carving.  I think it could have been much stronger with more detail on the exterior of the pumpkins showing.  The small amount that is there intreages (sp) me. 5</td>', 'This grouping works together with a common style of carving.  I think it could have been much stronger with more detail on the exterior of the pumpkins showing.  The small amount that is there intreages (sp) me. 5', '2005-11-01 01:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828904, 251969, 16230, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but his surroundings could use a bit of work.</td>', 'Not bad, but his surroundings could use a bit of work.', '2005-11-01 01:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828906, 251670, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the corpse, but looks like the pumpkin got Neat Imaged too much or something?  Still a cool scene.</td>', 'Great detail on the corpse, but looks like the pumpkin got Neat Imaged too much or something?  Still a cool scene.', '2005-11-01 01:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828907, 251926, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice carving.</td>', 'Nice carving.', '2005-11-01 01:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828908, 251940, 34659, '<td valign="top">Certainly seems happy for a hothead!  ;-)  Cute.</td>', 'Certainly seems happy for a hothead!  ;-)  Cute.', '2005-11-01 01:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828909, 251970, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool idea - not sure about the toothpicks.  Still, got good detail and color in the photo.</td>', 'Cool idea - not sure about the toothpicks.  Still, got good detail and color in the photo.', '2005-11-01 01:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828911, 251959, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great carving.</td>', 'Great carving.', '2005-11-01 01:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828912, 250405, 38223, '<td valign="top">This one''s a winner :)</td>', 'This one''s a winner :)', '2005-11-01 01:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828915, 251999, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a fun, wacky face here.  I''m missing the crispnes and detail that lets me know it is a carved pumpkin.  It comes across as an amusing overexposed light source without a form. IMO, some light on the outer surface would increase my interest. 4</td>', 'You''ve got a fun, wacky face here.  I''m missing the crispnes and detail that lets me know it is a carved pumpkin.  It comes across as an amusing overexposed light source without a form. IMO, some light on the outer surface would increase my interest. 4', '2005-11-01 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828920, 251808, 29904, '<td valign="top">This is cool, but nothing is in focus  :(</td>', 'This is cool, but nothing is in focus  :(', '2005-11-01 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828923, 251937, 39429, '<td valign="top">While you have done a nice capture of the candle, the overall impact of the shot wasn''t there for me.  I like the concept, and would love to see this with more DOF and a small amount of exterior lighting. 4</td>', 'While you have done a nice capture of the candle, the overall impact of the shot wasn''t there for me.  I like the concept, and would love to see this with more DOF and a small amount of exterior lighting. 4', '2005-11-01 01:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828925, 251937, 29904, '<td valign="top">Nice absract!</td>', 'Nice absract!', '2005-11-01 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828929, 251997, 39429, '<td valign="top">There is not enough detail or interest in this shot to keep my attention.  I would love to see a tighter crop, a bit of exterior lighting and/or the shot taken from a side angle.  I do like the reflected glow on the ground. 4</td>', 'There is not enough detail or interest in this shot to keep my attention.  I would love to see a tighter crop, a bit of exterior lighting and/or the shot taken from a side angle.  I do like the reflected glow on the ground. 4', '2005-11-01 01:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828934, 251944, 39429, '<td valign="top">Burnface comes across as horrific to me instead of appealing.  Technically, you''ve got a nice focus and some good detail.  I like the flame effect (but would like to see the end of it, instead of it being cropped off.) 4</td>', 'Burnface comes across as horrific to me instead of appealing.  Technically, you''ve got a nice focus and some good detail.  I like the flame effect (but would like to see the end of it, instead of it being cropped off.) 4', '2005-11-01 01:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828936, 251946, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a nice glow here from the flame, especially around the cap.  However, the lack of crispness and bland composition keep it from being very strong for me. 4</td>', 'You''ve captured a nice glow here from the flame, especially around the cap.  However, the lack of crispness and bland composition keep it from being very strong for me. 4', '2005-11-01 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828939, 251614, 29904, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!</td>', 'Excellent lighting!', '2005-11-01 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828942, 251728, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a nice glow here, especially through the pumpkin walls.  I originally gave it a 4 and am bumping it to 5.  It is a pleasant shot, but is missing the extra umph that add the wow.</td>', 'You''ve captured a nice glow here, especially through the pumpkin walls.  I originally gave it a 4 and am bumping it to 5.  It is a pleasant shot, but is missing the extra umph that add the wow.', '2005-11-01 01:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828944, 251788, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is the best one in this challenge! Good work on the carving and presentation.</td>', 'This is the best one in this challenge! Good work on the carving and presentation.', '2005-11-01 01:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828964, 251302, 40703, '<td valign="top">I love how each pumpkin is faced in a direction suited to their emotions. Or at least that''s what I see.</td>', 'I love how each pumpkin is faced in a direction suited to their emotions. Or at least that''s what I see.', '2005-11-01 01:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828972, 251302, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve got an interesting concept here which takes this shot out of the common "shoot the pumpkin" image.  I especially like the fact that the subject is male and is juggling emotion - nice.  The technical aspects, the concept works - congratulations.  I expect to see this shot on the front page.  8</td>', 'You''ve got an interesting concept here which takes this shot out of the common "shoot the pumpkin" image.  I especially like the fact that the subject is male and is juggling emotion - nice.  The technical aspects, the concept works - congratulations.  I expect to see this shot on the front page.  8', '2005-11-01 01:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828976, 251948, 39429, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Your pumpkins have interesting expressions with a great glow AND expterior detail.  The setup in the doorway (?) works very well with the texture adding interest, yet not taking away from the subject.  Very well done. 8</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Your pumpkins have interesting expressions with a great glow AND expterior detail.  The setup in the doorway (?) works very well with the texture adding interest, yet not taking away from the subject.  Very well done. 8', '2005-11-01 01:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828982, 251788, 39429, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting carving and very different from the other entries.  It is very effective.  The tire in the back left corner is distracting, as well as the canvas and pumpkin at the top right.  Even so, it''s nicely done. 8</td>', 'This is an interesting carving and very different from the other entries.  It is very effective.  The tire in the back left corner is distracting, as well as the canvas and pumpkin at the top right.  Even so, it''s nicely done. 8', '2005-11-01 01:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828984, 251208, 39429, '<td valign="top">This is sooo wrong, and still I laugh out loud.  Great carving and good, clean photo. 7</td>', 'This is sooo wrong, and still I laugh out loud.  Great carving and good, clean photo. 7', '2005-11-01 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1828985, 251031, 39560, '<td valign="top">This is morbid, but cool. I like it. But I''m a sicko anyway</td>', 'This is morbid, but cool. I like it. But I''m a sicko anyway', '2005-11-01 01:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829003, 251208, 25355, '<td valign="top">More like a symbiotic relationship, like those little fish that live in the mouths of bigger fish.</td>', 'More like a symbiotic relationship, like those little fish that live in the mouths of bigger fish.', '2005-11-01 02:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829004, 251788, 25355, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s kind of creepy. Unfortunately, the bit of thread hanging front of the face spoils it somewhat.</td>', 'Yep, that''s kind of creepy. Unfortunately, the bit of thread hanging front of the face spoils it somewhat.', '2005-11-01 02:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
