(1829155, 250853, 35602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful carving job.  I loved the cat.  Looks really good.  The eyes came out awesome on that one.  Lighting is so nice, too.  Wonder how it would have looked with a solid background, like rice paper or something with a soft glow from behind.  Just a suggestion.</td>', 'Wonderful carving job.  I loved the cat.  Looks really good.  The eyes came out awesome on that one.  Lighting is so nice, too.  Wonder how it would have looked with a solid background, like rice paper or something with a soft glow from behind.  Just a suggestion.', '2005-11-01 07:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829156, 251636, 42840, '<td valign="top">amazing! 10 points</td>', 'amazing! 10 points', '2005-11-01 07:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
