(1829159, 251582, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really bizarre.  Did the pumpkin grow that on the side?  Didn''t care for the black and white treatment, though.  Maybe if you had toned it differently it would have been less flat.</td>', 'Really bizarre.  Did the pumpkin grow that on the side?  Didn''t care for the black and white treatment, though.  Maybe if you had toned it differently it would have been less flat.', '2005-11-01 07:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
