(1829652, 251937, 41799, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective. Not sure if the lack of focus was intentional or not but that''d be my only complaint, I''d like to see the edges of the gap more defined.</td>', 'Neat perspective. Not sure if the lack of focus was intentional or not but that''d be my only complaint, I''d like to see the edges of the gap more defined.', '2005-11-01 11:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829657, 251430, 41799, '<td valign="top">Nice carving, and I really like the light cast on the wall. Just wish I could actually see what the light on the wall was meant to be (maybe I''m just missing it).</td>', 'Nice carving, and I really like the light cast on the wall. Just wish I could actually see what the light on the wall was meant to be (maybe I''m just missing it).', '2005-11-01 11:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829669, 251946, 41799, '<td valign="top">Overall nice carving, I like how you captures the glow of the pumpkin flesh in the non-carved locations. The bats do seem to be a bit over-exposed though (but I acknowledge that the other glow would be lost if you reduced the exposure too muchy)</td>', 'Overall nice carving, I like how you captures the glow of the pumpkin flesh in the non-carved locations. The bats do seem to be a bit over-exposed though (but I acknowledge that the other glow would be lost if you reduced the exposure too muchy)', '2005-11-01 11:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829680, 251525, 41799, '<td valign="top">Exceptional setup, the classic faces are a nice sight and (if my interpretation is correct) the Charlie Brown costume pumpkin is excellent. The light in the eyes of the two faces seems a bit too bright when compared with the light of the tall pumpkin and the candy, it looks photoshopped but if it is natural, I''d lean towards an extra light source on the candy and inside the tall pumpkin instead of a longer exposure.</td>', 'Exceptional setup, the classic faces are a nice sight and (if my interpretation is correct) the Charlie Brown costume pumpkin is excellent. The light in the eyes of the two faces seems a bit too bright when compared with the light of the tall pumpkin and the candy, it looks photoshopped but if it is natural, I''d lean towards an extra light source on the candy and inside the tall pumpkin instead of a longer exposure.', '2005-11-01 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829712, 251999, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Great google eyes, very cheerful!</td>', 'Nice picture. Great google eyes, very cheerful!', '2005-11-01 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829714, 251972, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice carving. Love the detail. I really like the way you caught the light through the window.</td>', 'Nice carving. Love the detail. I really like the way you caught the light through the window.', '2005-11-01 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1829715, 251993, 35507, '<td valign="top">Love it, quite the cut up...</td>', 'Love it, quite the cut up...', '2005-11-01 11:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
