(1831303, 251788, 42714, '<td valign="top">Great piece of carving, also relieved to see a daytime shot with some good lighting and combination of materials and textures.</td>', 'Great piece of carving, also relieved to see a daytime shot with some good lighting and combination of materials and textures.', '2005-11-01 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
