(1831315, 251167, 25183, '<td valign="top">This is great!  One of my favorites just for the swirly sparklie light thingy!  Nice tough to give a slightly different look to the over all photo.</td>', 'This is great!  One of my favorites just for the swirly sparklie light thingy!  Nice tough to give a slightly different look to the over all photo.', '2005-11-01 22:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1831320, 251596, 42714, '<td valign="top">This is a really understated photograph, and I like it.  This is one of the less decorative pumpkins, yet one of the best photos I''ve seen.  You make good use of the surrounding textures, contrast in color the composition and proportions are good, and the DOF all cause the eye to focus on the pumpkin.  You don''t try to to do too much with the lighting...(I don''t know if it''s natural or unnatural)....it''s just plain and simple.  Kudos.</td>', 'This is a really understated photograph, and I like it.  This is one of the less decorative pumpkins, yet one of the best photos I''ve seen.  You make good use of the surrounding textures, contrast in color the composition and proportions are good, and the DOF all cause the eye to focus on the pumpkin.  You don''t try to to do too much with the lighting...(I don''t know if it''s natural or unnatural)....it''s just plain and simple.  Kudos.', '2005-11-01 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1831321, 251596, 25183, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting.  I like the rugged look of the pumpkins surroundings.  Such a nice symmetrical face on that Jack.  You know it wasn''t carved by moi!</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting.  I like the rugged look of the pumpkins surroundings.  Such a nice symmetrical face on that Jack.  You know it wasn''t carved by moi!', '2005-11-01 22:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
