(1832847, 250537, 41522, '<td valign="top">Great carving.  The photo is good, but I think it would have been a little more pleasing if you had not placed the top of the ghost at the same level as the top of the pumpkin.  Generally speaking, I find compositions to e more pleasing when things aren''t on the same level.  This is a design rule regarding portraits with 2 or more people, bt I think it applies here too.  JMO.</td>', 'Great carving.  The photo is good, but I think it would have been a little more pleasing if you had not placed the top of the ghost at the same level as the top of the pumpkin.  Generally speaking, I find compositions to e more pleasing when things aren''t on the same level.  This is a design rule regarding portraits with 2 or more people, bt I think it applies here too.  JMO.', '2005-11-02 11:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
