(1833160, 250853, 29904, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is so perfect, great settup, perfect focus, good job on the carving, like the way the stems are pointed creating leading lines.<br/>My only suggestions - could do without the stuff on the right, it a little busy as is, and the window lines make it look tilted left, perhaps you could have tilted the image to the rt and cropped a touch off the bottom.  But thats just nit picky suggestions cause it''s so close to perfect!</td>', 'The lighting on this is so perfect, great settup, perfect focus, good job on the carving, like the way the stems are pointed creating leading lines.My only suggestions - could do without the stuff on the right, it a little busy as is, and the window lines make it look tilted left, perhaps you could have tilted the image to the rt and cropped a touch off the bottom.  But thats just nit picky suggestions cause it''s so close to perfect!', '2005-11-02 13:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833343, 250405, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good work for both the carving and the photo.  Definitely a unique set up.  I like the bubles on the pumpkin and the magnification factor of the water.  If I had a little nit to pick it would be that the top of the photo is a little too bright for my liking.  Overall good work.</td>', 'Good work for both the carving and the photo.  Definitely a unique set up.  I like the bubles on the pumpkin and the magnification factor of the water.  If I had a little nit to pick it would be that the top of the photo is a little too bright for my liking.  Overall good work.', '2005-11-02 13:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
