(1833855, 251953, 41522, '<td valign="top">Cool carving!!!!  Very good processing for the grunge look.  The blood trickle on the pumpkin is almost impossible to see. Overall, very good on both the carving and image work!!!</td>', 'Cool carving!!!!  Very good processing for the grunge look.  The blood trickle on the pumpkin is almost impossible to see. Overall, very good on both the carving and image work!!!', '2005-11-02 15:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
