(1833867, 251909, 41522, '<td valign="top">The carving on it''s own looks pretty good.  The photo, IMHO, could have had better focus and lighting.  JMO.</td>', 'The carving on it''s own looks pretty good.  The photo, IMHO, could have had better focus and lighting.  JMO.', '2005-11-02 15:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
