(1837131, 251823, 41522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful carving!!!!  Nice photo.  I like the composition and that there is some colour to the outside of the pumpkin.  I think the glow from the pumpkin, especially on the right side, is a little overpowering ... maybe because of the quick transition from soft glow to intense.  JMO.</td>', 'Wonderful carving!!!!  Nice photo.  I like the composition and that there is some colour to the outside of the pumpkin.  I think the glow from the pumpkin, especially on the right side, is a little overpowering ... maybe because of the quick transition from soft glow to intense.  JMO.', '2005-11-03 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
