(1837142, 251358, 41522, '<td valign="top">Cool pumpkin.  Nice simple carving but good spooky factor for the carving.  I like how much of the vine is still attached.  I like the processing of the image. for a slight grunge.  I think that in this case, an off-centred composition might have been a little more pleasing.  Also, I think I might have lijed a touch more glow coming from inside the pumpkin.</td>', 'Cool pumpkin.  Nice simple carving but good spooky factor for the carving.  I like how much of the vine is still attached.  I like the processing of the image. for a slight grunge.  I think that in this case, an off-centred composition might have been a little more pleasing.  Also, I think I might have lijed a touch more glow coming from inside the pumpkin.', '2005-11-03 23:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
