(1845909, 251937, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view. I like the shapes that the partially removed lid make. It reminds me of peeking into my own jack-o-lanterns just to see the flame  as a kid.</td>', 'Interesting point of view. I like the shapes that the partially removed lid make. It reminds me of peeking into my own jack-o-lanterns just to see the flame  as a kid.', '2005-11-07 20:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
