(1845922, 251928, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice one for the family album! The kids are so sweet and the porch so neatly dressed for the holiday! If only the girl were looking up...it''d be so much more satisfying!</td>', 'Nice one for the family album! The kids are so sweet and the porch so neatly dressed for the holiday! If only the girl were looking up...it''d be so much more satisfying!', '2005-11-07 20:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
