(1846623, 251956, 39141, '<td valign="top">Wow! I knew I could make top 100 in this one but this is amazing - I''m a happy guy.<br/>Thank you for the votes and the comments. <br/>I didn''t even see the grey bar on the side until the next day - its my inept use of photoshop. I had submitted an individual pumpkin photo (the grandkid with the led light in this photo) which I was reasonably happy with. Then when I had the family set up for Hallowe''en - adjusting candles, arrangements and exposures (while the trick''r''treaters were visiting),  got this one with about 45 minutes left (we are 3 hrs behind dpc time). In my haste prepping the pic, the grey bar appeared. Oh well, the family was interesting enough to distract- I''ll post a corrected version.<br/>Thank you again dpc''ers, and thank you to Sara, Caitlyn and Lisa who did a lot of the carving.</td>', 'Wow! I knew I could make top 100 in this one but this is amazing - I''m a happy guy.Thank you for the votes and the comments. I didn''t even see the grey bar on the side until the next day - its my inept use of photoshop. I had submitted an individual pumpkin photo (the grandkid with the led light in this photo) which I was reasonably happy with. Then when I had the family set up for Hallowe''en - adjusting candles, arrangements and exposures (while the trick''r''treaters were visiting),  got this one with about 45 minutes left (we are 3 hrs behind dpc time). In my haste prepping the pic, the grey bar appeared. Oh well, the family was interesting enough to distract- I''ll post a corrected version.Thank you again dpc''ers, and thank you to Sara, Caitlyn and Lisa who did a lot of the carving.', '2005-11-08 02:13:08.000000', NULL, 0),
